{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":32,"ref":"proverbs 30:32","book":"proverbs","lang":"de","chapter":30,"translation":"Wenn du dich töricht verhalten ⟨hast⟩, ⟨indem⟩ du dich erhöhst, und wenn du Böses planst — ⟨die⟩ Hand ⟨an⟩ ⟨den⟩ Mund!","tokens":[{"surface":"אם","gloss":"Wenn"},{"surface":"נבלת","gloss":"du dich töricht verhalten"},{"surface":"בהתנשא","gloss":"⟨indem⟩ du dich erhöhst"},{"surface":"ואם","gloss":"und wenn"},{"surface":"זמות","gloss":"du Böses planst"},{"surface":"יד","gloss":"⟨die⟩ Hand"},{"surface":"לפה","gloss":"⟨an⟩ ⟨den⟩ Mund"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-05T23:15:24.707434580Z","model":"glm-5.2"}